        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LZpqdj6qhoRY8YxKre2lpQ6QgIf\"><em><strong>The chart below shows the water levels of 6 cities in Australia in October 2009 and 2010. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Water Levels in 6 Australian Cities: 2009 vs 2010</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TqPldEHP5oO9Eqxr2kRlefpxgtb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ADwWdVrRFospcWxrEg3l62LygCb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Water Levels in 6 Australian Cities: 2009 vs 2010 y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả mực nước trong c&aacute;c hồ chứa nước của s&aacute;u th&agrave;nh phố ở Australia.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Uk1Dda6i8okpzoxOJ7RlrMuGgpg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuyet-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tuyệt đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span> trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AFdcdy0K8oOSp6x95l2lfTwogCb\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Water Levels in 6 Australian Cities: 2009 vs 2010 với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: mực nước hồ chứa - tỉ lệ phần trăm - dung t&iacute;ch tối đa - s&aacute;u th&agrave;nh phố ở Autralia - Th&aacute;ng Mười 2009 v&agrave; 2010.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pm69dDmtool4tjxlltPlXk6JgJf\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O0CtdGCDwoGwI0xd1Crlw2MlgAN\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends: </strong>mực nước ở đa phần c&aacute;c th&agrave;nh phố đều tăng sau một năm, chỉ c&oacute; ở Darwin giảm</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ww9xdPL3Ko8nb0x1rcDloDdBgID\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences: </strong>Canberra vừa c&oacute; mực nước cao nhất, vừa tăng đ&aacute;ng kể nhất</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-APeudfcnGokeKfxzDvQl1ZTYg0b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FLrHdc701owzfzxHR4Al2Nq3ggc\">\n<div data-lark-html-role=\"root\"><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"10\">Theo </span><strong><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"11\">Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></span></strong><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"12\">, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</span></div>\n<div data-lark-html-role=\"root\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QezvdrjxYoqa2zxM72JlCFusgFO\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Sydney, Canberra, v&agrave; Brisbane</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QezvdrjxYoqa2zxM72JlCFusgFO\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NQsDdqIqFoFjV0xCor0lVc5SgZg\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q4LTdhGAXonODox8cq1lhpCog0g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 2009 </strong><em>(Sydney v&agrave; Canberra đều l&agrave; 75%, Brisbane l&agrave; 55%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D1IBdsVe9oOi7BxRmcYl4Pbmgcf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của Brisbane </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>giữ nguy&ecirc;n</strong></em><em> ở 55% đến năm 2010)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-URB8dCgwQoyYstxe0POlnsgmgce\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của Sydney </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>tăng nhẹ</strong></em><em> l&ecirc;n 81% v&agrave;o năm 2010)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-As0rdWWdLoaQAwxCH95lN4x2gyg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 4) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của Canberra</strong> <em>(</em><em><strong>tăng đ&aacute;ng kể </strong></em><em>v&agrave; đạt đỉnh 98% v&agrave;o năm 2010)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CMAGdlHtOoSFpCx9IcOlPJTJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VY8Vd8h5aobxxpxPMEPlRpFpghd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: </strong><strong>Darwin, Perth, v&agrave; Melbourne</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VY8Vd8h5aobxxpxPMEPlRpFpghd\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NQsDdqIqFoFjV0xCor0lVc5SgZg\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FmNldSQvHo5JJGx3jylluEusgdb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 2009 </strong><em>(Darwin l&agrave; 44% v&agrave; Perth l&agrave; 40%, gần bằng nhau, trong khi Melbourne c&oacute; mức thấp nhất l&agrave; 25%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RgwVdnknRoeUSKx203sltPVkgty\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của Perth </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>tăng mạnh</strong></em><em> đến 61% v&agrave;o năm 2010)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FPtsdlG22oA272xwOxxlyXrggpc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của Darwin </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>giảm </strong></em><em>c&ograve;n khoảng 28% v&agrave;o năm 2010)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XLIYdqSVqowa33x3Y9blcYdSgYc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 4) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của Melbourne </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>tăng đ&aacute;ng kể</strong></em><em> đến 38% v&agrave;o năm 2010)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J6hPduw5Eouj2oxD8H8lGM0cgLb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi muốn diễn đạt <strong>\"mực nước hồ chứa\"</strong>, thay v&igrave; d&ugrave;ng <strong>\"water level\"</strong> th&igrave; m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể paraphrase với c&aacute;c cụm danh từ <strong>\"water storage/reservoir level/water reserves/reservoirs\" </strong>để đa dạng cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u của m&igrave;nh hơn nh&eacute;.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bxkgd0YqxolYycxQAu7l4CALgFb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W48sdItQKoSl2oxNAdLlyQPmgbv\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Overall, most cities witnessed an increase in their <strong>water storage</strong> over the one-year period.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VolNdUB7Hoh0osxWYOxlwaIVgce\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Additionally, Canberra not only maintained the highest <strong>reservoir level</strong> but also showed the most significant rise among all cities.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GLtUdzBLXo6spYxFZoFlWWPdgcc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Looking at cities with higher <strong>water reserves</strong>, Sydney and Canberra both recorded figures of approximately 75% in 2009, whereas Brisbane's <strong>reservoirs</strong> were about 55% full.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
