          {
            "id": 597,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K1dtdpPMVoY6zlxzaqelyLI7gOb\">Overall, most cities witnessed an increase in their water storage over the one-year period, with the exception of Darwin, which experienced a decline. Additionally, Canberra not only maintained the highest reservoir level but also showed the most significant rise among all cities.</div>\n</div>",
